 "description": "Build Upsilon's portable sigrank/0.1-draft compatibility record from available token telemetry. Input and output are required; unavailable cache telemetry remains null. Computes the canonical cascade locally through token-cascade and returns Yield, Leverage, Velocity, SNR, and 10xDEV. Upsilon is the measurement product; SigRank is the public leaderboard. No data is submitted or persisted.",
